cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Kestrel in research or publications, please cite it as:"
type: software
title: Kestrel
abstract: >
  Kestrel is an AI-native security operations platform that combines
  LLM-driven agent orchestration, MCP-based recon-tool automation,
  human-in-the-loop approval workflows, RBAC, append-only audit logging,
  and a graph-based workflow engine into a single self-contained Go binary.
authors:
  - family-names: "Kestrel Contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/AMG555/Kestrel"
